    "body": "Fixed on head f1baf28ba. Answers to the four review points:\n\n1. Playback: I removed the playback sentence from `site/templates/index.html` and `site/content/guide/first-run.md`. The code does not confirm a limit. The PR body says a new sentence needs a check in the browser build first.\n2. Post: both files now say that Post downloads the program when Output is set to one combined program. They say that one file for each operation is refused. This matches the `PostProgramDialog if per_op` arm of `browser_files::refusal`.\n3. Greyed controls: both files now say \"greyed, or refused with the reason on the status line\". This is true for the theme picker and for the other refused commands.\n4. PR body: I corrected the body. It no longer says the playback sentence is unchanged. It now matches the new text.\n\nThe PR stays a draft. Labels are not changed.\n",
